Package: com.albrhi.mirror.probe
Name: Albrhi Mirror (stage 1)
Version: 0.3.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Stage 1 of a screen mirroring experiment: an app to switch it on and pair a Mac, and a service that captures the screen and reports what the phone allows, including while locked. Off until switched on; loopback only.
Maintainer: Ibrahim Ismail AL-Rahn
Author: Ibrahim Ismail AL-Rahn
Section: Utilities
Depends: firmware (>= 14.0)
